## Cite GitHub #186 in the 0.8.1 release notes

Context: Issue #186 (Data Quality IF-condition property dropdown blanks on
selection) was verified as already fixed on 0.8.1 (`69ced25e`) and closed as
status: Solved. The release notes already described the fix but did not link
the GitHub issue. User-guide and product docs already document the IF block as
current behaviour, so they were left unchanged.

Changes:

1. releases/ReleaseNotes_V0.8.1.md
   Link [#186](https://github.com/databrickslabs/ontobricks/issues/186) in the
   highlights, Data Quality conditions section, and selected bug-fix list.
2. changelogs/v0.8.1/benoitcayladbx_2026-10-01.log
   Record the documentation-only release-note citation.

